4:38</span> 43. Nasaraṇaṃ nanahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nasaraṇo nanahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-64m-43</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1488.929865\">24:48</span> Naaraṇaṃ nanahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca naaraṇo nanahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1).</p><p><br /></p><p>Hetuyā dve…pe… avigate dve. (Sabbattha vitthāro.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-2-6. Saraṇaduka-sahetukādidukāni ^7-64n-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1504.320422\">25:04</span> 44. Nasaraṇaṃ nasahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nahetusampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64n-44</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nahetuvippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1525.139801\">25:25</span> 45. Nasaraṇaṃ nahetuñceva naahetukañca dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naahetukañceva nana ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nahetuñceva nahetuvippayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nahetuvippayuttañceva nana ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64n-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1548.519555\">25:48</span> Nasaraṇaṃ nahetuṃ nasahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nahetuṃ naahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-7-13. Saraṇaduka-cūḷantaradukāni ^7-64o-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1558.187731\">25:58</span> 46. Nasaraṇaṃ naappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naasaṅkhataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64o-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1566.67517\">26:06</span> Nasaraṇaṃ nasanidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nasappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1575.038526\">26:15</span> Nasaraṇaṃ naappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ narūpiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1582.706786\">26:22</span> Nasar