maṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nooghaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ noyogaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nonīvaraṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ noparāmāsaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64q-49</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-55-68. Saraṇaduka-mahantaradukāni ^7-64r-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1694.820814\">28:14</span> 50. Nasaraṇaṃ nasārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-64r-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1701.728225\">28:21</span>  Nasaraṇaṃ nacittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nacetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1712.810636\">28:32</span> Nasaraṇaṃ nacittasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nacittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1721.508872\">28:41</span> Nasaraṇaṃ nacittasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nacittasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nacittānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1734.314055\">28:54</span> 51. Nasaraṇaṃ nacittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nacittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nacittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64r-51</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1750.735596\">29:10</span> Nasaraṇaṃ naajjhattikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nabāhiraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1758.872884\">29:18</span> Nasaraṇaṃ naupādā dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ naupādinnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ naanupādinnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-69-82. Saraṇaduka-upādānādidukāni ^7-64s-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1771.677406\">29:31</span> 52. Nasaraṇaṃ naupādānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64s-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1775.85096\">29:35</span> 53. Nasaraṇaṃ nokilesaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64s-53</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-83. Saraṇaduka-dassanādidukāni ^7-64t-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1780.165564\">29:40</span> 54. Nasaraṇaṃ nadassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nanadassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nabhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nanabhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca …pe… nasaraṇaṃ nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca …pe… nasaraṇaṃ nanadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64t-54</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nanabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1823.339199\">30:23</span> 55. Nasaraṇaṃ nasavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64t-55</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ naavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1843.1538\">30:43</span> 56. Nasaraṇaṃ nasappītikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naappītikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ napītisahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nanapītisahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nasukhasahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nanasukhasahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naupekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64t-56</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1877.35998\">31:17</span> 57. Nasaraṇaṃ nanaupekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64t-57</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1882.263188\">31:22</span> Nasaraṇaṃ nakāmāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ nanakāmāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1890.576828\">31:30</span> 58. Nasaraṇaṃ narūpāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nanarūpāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naarūpāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64t-58</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1904.039701\">31:44</span> Nasaraṇaṃ nanaarūpāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ napariyāpannaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ naapariyāpannaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1917.336215\">31:57</span> 59. Nasaraṇaṃ naniyyānikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ^7-64t-59</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1921.342513\">32:01</span> Nasaraṇaṃ naaniyyānikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ naniyataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇaṃ naaniyataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1932.976627\">32:12</span> 60. Nasaraṇaṃ nasauttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nasaraṇo nasauttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. ^7-64t-60</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1947.64413\">32:27</span> Nasaraṇaṃ naanuttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nasaraṇo naanuttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1957.606736\">32:37</span> Naaraṇaṃ naanuttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca naaraṇo naanuttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naaraṇaṃ naanuttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nasaraṇo naanuttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naaraṇaṃ naanuttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nasaraṇo naanuttaro ca naaraṇo naanuttaro ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1988.082541\">33:08</span> Nasaraṇaṃ naanuttarañca naaraṇaṃ naanuttarañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nasaraṇo naanuttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2000.247325\">33:20</span> Hetuyā pañca. (Sabbattha vitthāro. Sahajātavārampi paccayavārampi nissayavārampi saṃsaṭṭhavārampi sampayuttavārampi pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Dhammapaccanīye dukadukapaṭṭhānaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>Paccanīyapaṭṭhānaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p>","media-time":2027.454535}